### [159] S260  Admin dashboard summary
### phase: P16   auth: adminToken   expect: [200]
### note: Security note: DashboardsController carries NO [Authorize] attribute. The guard is the [Permission] marker inside each handler, so a token with no permissions still gets 403. Verify that a staff token WITHOUT the right permission is rejected.

GET /api/v1/Dashboards/admin
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


################################################################################################
### [160] S261  Instructor dashboard summary
### phase: P16   auth: instructorToken   expect: [200]

GET /api/v1/Dashboards/instructor
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}


