### phase: P16   auth: userToken   expect: [200]
### note: Run this after S130 and S200 so the numbers are non-zero and meaningful.

GET /api/v1/Dashboards/student
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}


################################################################################################
### [162] S263  A student cannot read the admin dashboard (negative check)
### phase: P16   auth: userToken   expect: [401, 403]
